    <div class="rev"><div class="rev__h"><div class="rev__av">JL</div><div><div class="rev__n">James L.</div><div class="rev__m">Columbus, OH · Verified ✓</div></div></div><div class="stars" style="font-size:.8rem">★★★★★</div><p>Wife has a whole shelf. I've got one jar. And honestly mine's easier to keep up with than her ten bottles. Zero smell, not greasy. Sold.</p></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="rev__h"><div class="rev__av">RC</div><div><div class="rev__n">Rob C.</div><div class="rev__m">Sacramento, CA · Verified ✓</div></div></div><div class="stars" style="font-size:.8rem">★★★★★</div><p>The one thing in my day that's mine. Ten seconds, nobody needs anything from me. Looking less rough by Friday is the bonus.</p></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="rev__h"><div class="rev__av">PK</div><div><div class="rev__n">Paul K.</div><div class="rev__m">Portland, OR · Verified ✓</div></div></div><div class="stars" style="font-size:.8rem">★★★★★</div><p>Bought it for the dad angle. Stayed for the skin. My face doesn't look so tired by Friday anymore.</p></div>
